---
import ServiceLayout from '../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<ServiceLayout
	title="Business IT projects | Servo ICT"
	description="Windows device, account and UniFi setup and improvement projects for small businesses, delivered remotely or in Gippsland by arrangement."
	canonicalPath="/business-it/"
	eyebrow="Business IT"
	headline="Business systems without the daily workarounds."
	intro="Servo ICT sets up and improves Windows devices, business accounts, UniFi networks and the systems a small business relies on. Work is delivered remotely by default, with visits in Gippsland available by arrangement."
	goodFit={[
		'Important access lives with former staff or an outside supplier.',
		'Email, files or team tools need to move without unnecessary disruption.',
		'Windows devices, business accounts or a UniFi network need a consistent setup.',
		'No one has a clear record of the systems the business depends on.'
	]}
	typicalWork={[
		{ title: 'Email and account ownership', description: 'Review business email, accounts and access, then agree on the setup or migration work your systems need.' },
		{ title: 'Windows device setup', description: 'Prepare Windows computers with a consistent setup, automatic updates and the accounts and tools each person needs.' },
		{ title: 'UniFi networks', description: 'Set up or improve UniFi networking for suitable small business premises, including clear ownership and handover.' },
		{ title: 'Client-managed systems', description: 'Set up systems your business can manage, document the important details and arrange an optional check-in about every six months.' }
	]}
	enquiryService="technology"
	beforeEnquiring={[
		{
			question: 'What will the work cost, and when can it start?',
			answer: 'Projects are quoted after confirming the systems, access and work involved. Your written proposal sets the fee, schedule, any travel costs and handover. If the work is urgent, explain the impact so availability can be confirmed. There is no guaranteed emergency response.'
		},
		{
			question: 'Can you work with our current tools?',
			answer: 'List the tools and services involved, the devices and users affected, what is going wrong and any deadline or changeover constraint. Do not send passwords, recovery codes or other credentials in the initial enquiry. Servo ICT can then confirm whether the project is a fit.'
		},
		{
			question: 'Do you support Macs?',
			answer: 'Windows is the core supported desktop platform. If your business uses macOS, enquire with the device models, software and work required so Servo ICT can confirm whether it is a suitable project.'
		},
		{
			question: 'Do you provide ongoing managed IT?',
			answer: 'The main service is project setup and improvement of systems your business manages. Automatic updates can be configured where suitable, with an optional check-in roughly every six months. The review covers changes to devices, access, updates and recovery arrangements. Day-to-day management stays with your business.'
		},
		{
			question: 'Can you visit our workplace?',
			answer: 'Work is remote by default. Visits to businesses in Gippsland can be arranged when the job needs hands-on work.'
		}
	]}
	exampleScope={{
		scenario: 'A growing small team has inconsistent staff accounts and device setup. Administrative access is split between current staff, former staff and an outside supplier.',
		work: 'Map the accounts, devices and owners involved, agree on a standard setup, fix the priority access gaps and document the process for future staff changes.',
		inputs: 'A list of staff and devices, available administrative access, supplier details and a decision-maker who can confirm who should own each system.',
		timing: 'An initial review identifies the systems involved and any changeover constraints. You receive a written scope, quote and schedule before any account or device changes begin.',
		handover: 'You receive the agreed account and device setup, an ownership record and clear steps the business can follow when staff or equipment changes.'
	}}
	closingTitle="Start with the workaround everyone has learned to tolerate."
	closingCopy="Explain what people are trying to do, where it breaks down and which systems are involved. Get advice on a practical next step."
>
	<section slot="proof" class="before-enquiring" aria-labelledby="business-experience-title">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<p class="eyebrow">Relevant experience</p>
			<h2 id="business-experience-title">Practical systems experience</h2>
		</div>
		<p>Servo ICT brings Microsoft Fundamentals training, Azure consulting experience and cybersecurity experience to small business projects. The focus here is Windows devices, local networks and systems a small business can manage.</p>
	</section>
</ServiceLayout>
